    "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/job/537268/postdoctoral-fellow-in-the-school-of-nursing": {
      "title": "Career Opportunities",
      "description": "HKU Careers - Career Opportunities Skip to content HKU Home Home Start main Content Career Opportunities Home Explore Careers at HKU Career Opportunities Applicant login Job alert Internal openings Job Search e.g. Professor Refine Search Work type Full-time 1 Categories Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow 1 Faculty Li Ka Shing Faculty of Medicine 1 Post-doctoral Fellow in the School of Nursing The University of Hong Kong Apply now Ref.: 537268 Work type: Full-time Department: School of Nursing (20800) Categories: Senior Research Staff & Post-doctoral Fellow Hong Kong Applications are invited for appointment as Post-doctoral Fellow in the School of Nursing (Ref: 537268), to commence as soon as possible for one to two years, with the possibility of renewal subject to funding availability and satisfactory performance. Applicants should possess a Ph.D. degree in Nursing, Public Health, Social Sciences, Statistics or other health related disciplines. They should have an excellent command of spoken and written English and Chinese (including fluency in Cantonese), and demonstrate strong skills in statistical analysis, data management, and project coordination. Applicants should also exhibit the ability to work independently and collaboratively within a multidisciplinary team, as well as effectively engage with external stakeholders, including academics, social service groups, and policymakers. Experience on intervention studies and good track record on publications are advantages. The appointee will work on research project “ Health Programme for Adult Persons with Disabilities ” under the supervision of Prof. Kelvin Wang. He/she will coordinate research projects, implement research activities, analyse data, prepare scientific reports, liaise with community partners and institutions, and perform other duties as assigned. A highly competitive salary commensurate with qualifications and experience will be offered, in addition to annual leave and medical benefits. The University only accepts online application for the above post.  Applicants should apply online and upload an up-to-date C.V.  Review of applications will start as soon as possible and continue until December 31, 2026 , or until the post is filled, whichever is earlier. Advertised: Sep 1, 2026 (HK Time) Applications close: Dec 31, 2026 (HK Time) Back to search results Apply now Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537268 Post-doctoral Fellow in the School of Nursing School of Nursing (20800) Dec 31, 2026 Featured jobs Current opportunities Ref. Posting Title Department Closing Date 537268 Post-doctoral Fellow in the School of Nursing School of Nursing (20800) Dec 31, 2026 Powered by PageUp Copyright © 2026\n                Human Resources Office,\n                The University of Hong Kong. All Rights Reserved."
